From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roger Luethi <luethi@osism.tech>
Date: Fri, 5 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/23] horizon-always-configure-cache-backend

Restore the intent this patch had up to 2025.2 and lost when the set was
re-derived for 2026.1.

Up to 2025.2 the patch earned its name: _9998-kolla-settings.py.j2 only
mutated an already-existing CACHES dict, and the patch moved those
assignments out of the if/elif chain into a separate

    {% if groups['memcached'] | length > 0 %}

block, so the cache backend was configured whatever the session store was.

2026.1 restructured the template to define CACHES wholesale, inside the
same if/elif chain that selects SESSION_ENGINE:

    {% if horizon_backend_database | bool %}
    SESSION_ENGINE = '...backends.db'
    DATABASES = { ... }
    {% elif horizon_session_cache_backend == 'valkey' %}
    ...
    {% elif horizon_session_cache_backend == 'memcached' %}
    ...
    {% endif %}

The re-derived patch only added three pymemcache options inside the
memcached branch. With horizon_backend_database enabled the first branch
wins, the cache branches are never reached, and no CACHES is emitted at
all. Horizon then falls back to its own default -- PyMemcacheCache at
127.0.0.1:11211, where nothing listens -- and every request fails with

    pymemcache.exceptions.MemcacheError: All servers seem to be down right now

as HTTP 500. ignore_exc is not set either, so it cannot even degrade.

Decouple the two decisions the 2026.1 template conflated: the if/elif
picks SESSION_ENGINE, and a separate block emits CACHES from
horizon_session_cache_backend regardless of the session store.
horizon_session_cache_backend is defined independently of
horizon_backend_database (valkey -> memcached -> disabled), so no new
variable is needed.

Signed-off-by: Roger Luethi <luethi@osism.tech>
---
diff --git a/ansible/roles/horizon/templates/_9998-kolla-settings.py.j2 b/ansible/roles/horizon/templates/_9998-kolla-settings.py.j2
index e88afbdc3..6c1b25498 100644
--- a/ansible/roles/horizon/templates/_9998-kolla-settings.py.j2
+++ b/ansible/roles/horizon/templates/_9998-kolla-settings.py.j2
@@ -16,8 +16,11 @@ DATABASES = {
         'PORT': '{{ database_port }}'
     }
 }
-{% elif horizon_session_cache_backend == 'valkey' %}
+{% else %}
 SESSION_ENGINE = 'django.contrib.sessions.backends.cache'
+{% endif %}
+
+{% if horizon_session_cache_backend == 'valkey' %}
 CACHES = {
     'default': {
         'BACKEND': 'django_redis.cache.RedisCache',
@@ -39,7 +42,6 @@ CACHES = {
     }
 }
 {% elif horizon_session_cache_backend == 'memcached' %}
-SESSION_ENGINE = 'django.contrib.sessions.backends.cache'
 CACHES = {
     'default': {
         'BACKEND': 'django.core.cache.backends.memcached.PyMemcacheCache',
@@ -50,6 +52,9 @@ CACHES = {
         ],
         'OPTIONS': {
             'ignore_exc': True,
+            'no_delay': True,
+            'max_pool_size': 4,
+            'use_pooling': True,
         }
     }
 }
